style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;②　連結財務諸表提出会社の非連結子会社及び関連会社等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
